      "description": "Hourly helps you keep track of time. It's just like having a wristwatch that beeps on the hour, except it's much more personal!\n\nYou can choose:\n * The sound to play (from a simple wristwatch beep, to the legendary Greenwich Pips, to a spoken voice, or the chime of an old clock)\n * A message to display on the screen\n * Which hours, half hours, or any other times to notify you about\n\nWe think it's the best hourly chime app on the App Store, and we're always listening for your feedback if you think we can do better! No ads, no tracking, no In-App Purchases. Ever.",
